==Description==
'''Legacy''' is a narrator that appears in [[Golden Mode|Golden]] mode. It has no speaker name, has no appearance and does not even have a single animation.

'''Legacy''' is a recreation of the beginning text that appeared prior to the [[Overhaul v1.0|Overhaul Update]], where messages from an unknown source would appear. While generally not known who was sending them, there were rare cases, such as final wave of [[Easy Mode|Beginner's]] mode, where dialogue implied who it was coming from. In the case for the example listed, that would be [[Grave Digger]].

==Appearance==
'''Legacy''' has no actual appearance. The area in which a speaker is shown will instead always be empty.

==Trivia==
*Although classified as an animated [[Narrators|narrator]], '''Legacy''' by all practical means is not animated at all. 

